          "license": "CC BY 4.0",
          "locators": [
            {
              "excerpt": "    Let $G$ be a random 4-regular graph.  Is it true that the coefficient of $P_G$ at $\\prod_{v\\in V(G)} v^2$ is a.a.s. non-zero?",
              "excerpt_sha256": "c8edb2389bb84861f339951b10a3a7741c4b529626732014970a2aa8f4e16f1c",
              "label": "Problem 2.1",
              "page": 3,
              "purpose": "statement",
              "section": "2 Alon-Tarsi number of random 4-regular graphs"
            },
            {
              "excerpt": "Such a graph $G$ is a.a.s. 3-colorable~\\cite{threecol}, but it is an open question whether $G$ is",
              "excerpt_sha256": "7f615a540d26f5d7685b3b4d7ea6a8273b976466b715b1cc9c8a116a7a72208f",
              "label": "Open-question sentence before Problem 2.1",
